WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.490
- You both worked with
Sheryl Lee Ralph, right?

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:03.480
- Who I adore.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.313
- Yeah.

00:00:04.313 --> 00:00:05.146
- The great, the great Sheryl Lee Ralph.

00:00:05.146 --> 00:00:06.960
- [Rosie] She is something else.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:07.900
- [Tyler] Yes.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.112
- [Rosie] And I got to see her
in Dream Girls on Broadway.

00:00:10.112 --> 00:00:10.945
- You did?

00:00:10.945 --> 00:00:11.778
- Oh gosh.

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:12.840
- I did more than once
because that was the best show

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.190
I've ever seen in my life.

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:15.023
- Oh, I love that feeling.

00:00:15.023 --> 00:00:18.240
- And then she was the, we were
in The Flintstones together,

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.060
she ran the adoption agency
that got me Bamm-Bamm.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.340
So we've been friends for
a long time and I love her.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:26.070
I'm so happy she's
getting her rewards now.

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:27.602
- [Tyler] Oh, so am I, so am I.

00:00:27.602 --> 00:00:29.220
- Yeah, you have the same experience.

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:30.600
What does she, what does she mean to you?

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.600
- So Sheryl and I actually
go back pretty far.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.490
My baby brother, also a child actor,

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:38.160
did a show with her called
Instant Mom for four Years.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:38.993
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:38.993 --> 00:00:41.370
- So I met Sheryl, I
think back in like 2014

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:42.540
or something like that.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:46.350
And she was just so great
with him, teaching him how to

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.973
you know, cut his teeth
in the multicam world.

00:00:48.973 --> 00:00:51.240
And she was just one of those people

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.160
who was a constant in
my life at one point.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:55.080
So to now do a show with her

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:58.480
and to watch everyone
realize the magnitude

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:01.080
of who she is and watch her
get her flowers in that way,

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:03.090
it's been a long time coming for me.

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:05.540
I'm so happy that I could
even be a part of that.

